        </item>
        <item>
            <title>Quill 0.8.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 20:32:56 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <link>https://github.com/imtamiliniyan/quill/releases/tag/v0.8.0</link>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Real auto-update: Quill can now find and install its own updates (Sparkle), replacing the old manual GitHub-check.</li>
                    <li>Remove Filler Words moved from Voice Engine to Style, next to Auto Cleanup.</li>
                    <li>Check for Updates now shows Quill's actual app icon instead of a generic checkmark.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
